  "narration": [
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Over fifteen billion miles away, Voyager One was sending signals nobody could read.",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.95,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.13bf520e47d3017edf6d01162acc54de72cc1d6ffedf171a1ae820287ce9ab3f",
        "sha256": "13bf520e47d3017edf6d01162acc54de72cc1d6ffedf171a1ae820287ce9ab3f"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-2",
      "transcript": "The trouble began in November twenty twenty-three: a failed memory chip in its data-packaging computer.",
      "start": 6.233333333333333,
      "duration": 6.9,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.ae5666d0002f1f0bf70d1a34fd2ca594152e776460b68ecb95890ebebf1fa3c7",
        "sha256": "ae5666d0002f1f0bf70d1a34fd2ca594152e776460b68ecb95890ebebf1fa3c7"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Engineers couldn't repair the chip. So they moved the affected code.",
      "start": 13.4,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.085d3aa68fa95d9c9aecc93fa30b7aab7932625418e0815acddcca0810703435",
        "sha256": "085d3aa68fa95d9c9aecc93fa30b7aab7932625418e0815acddcca0810703435"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-4",
      "transcript": "But it wouldn't fit in one place.",
      "start": 18.1,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.58c9ccc8cbd018b594eeb7b0de940a7069c45350302cc56fe4c03b2c76a10c39",
        "sha256": "58c9ccc8cbd018b594eeb7b0de940a7069c45350302cc56fe4c03b2c76a10c39"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-5",
      "transcript": "They split it across working memory, then updated the instructions so the pieces still worked together.",
      "start": 20.733333333333334,
      "duration": 6.425,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.427d1a28f81910150d4f1cdb7aeabbc8e257951600dc9ba2ad624f2471cfc68f",
        "sha256": "427d1a28f81910150d4f1cdb7aeabbc8e257951600dc9ba2ad624f2471cfc68f"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-6",
      "transcript": "A command took about twenty-two and a half hours just to reach the spacecraft.",
      "start": 27.633333333333333,
      "duration": 4.875,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.efacc3e796b92d6225a251b261af1574838d5132abd6bc43b990e92ba32de4c1",
        "sha256": "efacc3e796b92d6225a251b261af1574838d5132abd6bc43b990e92ba32de4c1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-7",
      "transcript": "On April twentieth, twenty twenty-four, readable engineering data came back. Science data followed later.",
      "start": 32.9,
      "duration": 7.25,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.20d05ebe886c1ca6c5269a498efc087e91f9e1894df00738395d9eb18f46bcdc",
        "sha256": "20d05ebe886c1ca6c5269a498efc087e91f9e1894df00738395d9eb18f46bcdc"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-8",
      "transcript": "The chip stayed broken. The software worked around it.",
      "start": 40.53333333333333,
      "duration": 3.625,
      "media": {
        "id": "media.3f026291fd5576e996f9f08ad5e005ceaa58ea7f488e630d4fc0c0714a4b4342",
        "sha256": "3f026291fd5576e996f9f08ad5e005ceaa58ea7f488e630d4fc0c0714a4b4342"
      }
    }
